 of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1446785517519688", "version": "0.2.349"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1446785517519688"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Clay catches up with your hand faster: the surface behind a fast stroke fills in sooner on every Quest, and changing a layer's detail (Res + / -) finishes quicker.\r\n- Opening a sculpt uses less memory, which helps big sculpts load on Quest 2 and Quest Pro.\r\n- Fixed: a layer you weren't working on could show a flat patch after a small change until you selected it.\r\n- Hands: a little less work every frame while the Sculpt Panel is up.", "created_date": 1794259994, "id": "1446785517519688", "version": "0.2.349", "version_code": 349, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1446785517519688"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Smoother on Quest 3 and 3S: Clayground runs at 90 frames a second again whenever your sculpt allows. It had been stuck at 72.\r\n- Bend just part of your sculpt with Lattice: pick Lasso or Sphere next to Whole layer on the Tools page. With Sphere, pinch the clay (or tap the trigger) where you want to bend.\r\n- Moving around with hands is much easier: drag the new pad on the Sculpt Panel to turn and tilt your sculpt, swipe your sculpting thumb to turn it, or look at a spot and double-pinch your other hand to bring it to you.\r\n- The Sculpt Panel is shorter, stays beside your clay, catches quick taps the first time and has Photo on it. Hints follow your view. A pinch always sculpts, even with Fingers on.\r\n- New for hands: Fingers (every fingertip carves its own groove), Cast (your hands become clay), Print (press your hand into the clay) and Alive (your sculpt jiggles when poked). Flick the sculpt as you let go and it spins.\r\n- Fixed: strips of clay vanishing in the left eye on Quest 3 and 3S (shadows are gone for good), Undo of Merge, Subtract and Intersect losing clay, and a sculpt loading empty after its first layer was deleted.", "created_date": 1794198393, "id": "1446046784260228", "version": "0.2.348", "version_code": 348, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1446785517519688"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "smoother on quest 3s", "created_date": 1794165691, "id": "1445716427626597", "version": "0.2.347", "version_code": 347, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1446785517519688"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "huge fixes removed shadows", "created_date": 1794156619, "id": "1445591704305736", "version": "0.2.346", "version_code": 346, "release_status": "RELEASED", "s